		{
			title: "First, Make Powder"
			icon: "creategunpowder:volatile_powder"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
			description: [
				"No powder, no war. Create Gunpowder lets you mass-make gunpowder with machines instead of grinding creepers."
				"Mill charcoal, flint and minerals into dusts, then mix into Volatile Powder — that becomes your Gunpowder feedstock. (Hold [W] over an item for its Ponder.)"
