		{
			title: "Shells and Fuzes"
			icon: "createbigcannons:he_shell"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 6.0d
			description: [
				"Now the payloads. HE Shells hit harder than TNT; AP Shells punch through blocks and detonate inside. A shell does nothing without a fuze screwed to its nose."
				"Impact/Inertia fuzes trigger on contact, Timed/Proximity on a clock or range. Note: Solid Shot and AP Shot are pure kinetic — they cannot be fuzed."
